# Rust / PyO3 build output
# NOTE: the crate lives at rust/ember_core/, so its build dir is
# rust/ember_core/target/ (112 MB of artifacts) — a bare `rust/target/`
# pattern would NOT match it. Match target/ at any depth under rust/.
rust/target/
rust/**/target/

# Local working docs — intentionally NOT committed.
# Implementation records and the raw feature spec are kept locally as working
# notes only; the repo stays code + tests. (The records live on disk under
# implementation_records/ and are git-ignored here.)
implementation_records/
/features update
